  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: e9620f8c34305754d8cc9a7e49e852d9, type: 3}
  m_Name: LetterContent_en
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Unity.Localization::UnityEngine.Localization.Tables.StringTable
  m_LocaleId:
    m_Code: en
  m_SharedData: {fileID: 11400000, guid: b5f3eb02ba568a246a6991153cb662cc, type: 2}
  m_Metadata:
    m_Items: []
  m_TableData:
  - m_Id: 38003025727488
    m_Localized: 'To my sweetest little baker,


      I hope this letter finds thee
      well. Thy father tells me that some townsfolk have already begun visiting thy
      shop. Oh, how proud I am of thee! I always knew those little hands of thine
      would make wonderful things one day.


      With all the love in the world,

      mom.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 50901701709824
    m_Localized: 'To my sweetest little baker,


      Today, whilst resting by the
      window, I overheard two women speaking of a young baker whose bread is so wondrous
      even travelling merchants stop by. I could not help but smile! I wish I had
      been there to tell them such a gifted baker is my very own son.


      With
      all the love in the world,

      mom.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 57453489770496
    m_Localized: 'To my sweetest little baker,


      Thou shalt have placed thy
      mark upon the loaves that come forth from thy oven by now, has thou not? For
      every loaf that leaves thy over bear the mark of thy hands, for thus shall
      all know the labour throughout the kingdom.


      With all the love in the
      world,

      mom.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 61494328381440
    m_Localized: 'To my sweetest little baker,


      How I wish thou couldst be
      here today, seated by my side, if only for a fleeting moment... Whilst the
      scent of toasted almonds, flour and golden sugar fills our humble home. It
      shall always be the fragrance of our family, and I send thee my recipe so that,
      as thou prepare it, thou mayst feel a little closer to home.


      A little
      tear lath fallen as I wrote these words,

      mom.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 63549453455360
    m_Localized: 'My son,


      Has thou made any new acquaintances? I remember
      how shy thou art, and I daresay thou hast not even tried. I jest, of course.
      Thy mother is reading this very letter over my shoulder, and I fear I may not
      live long enough to send it.


      With much love,

      thy father.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 63579245596672
    m_Localized: 'My son,


      I write to inform thee that thy mother hath taken
      ill these past few days, nothing thou shouldst lose sleep over, yet she is
      in need of rest, thou mayst not recieve as many letters from her as she would
      wish. Think not that we hath forgotten thee.


      Lose not heart and continue
      thy good work,

      dad.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  references:
    version: 2
    RefIds: []
